"Agent 已完成或已清理，TraceFence 没有可继续的运行时会话。" = "The agent has finished or was cleaned up, so there is no runtime session to continue.";
"Claude Desktop 没有暴露 TraceFence 可调用的本地会话控制接口；TraceFence 可以监控它，并在本机安装 claude CLI 时接管到 Claude Code 可控会话。" = "Claude Desktop does not expose a local session-control API. TraceFence can monitor it and take the task over into a controlled Claude Code session when the claude CLI is installed.";
"Cursor Desktop 当前只作为桌面进程监控；如安装 cursor-agent，可接管到 TraceFence 可控 CLI 会话。" = "Cursor Desktop is currently monitored as a desktop process. If cursor-agent is installed, TraceFence can take it over into a controlled CLI session.";
"Trae Desktop 当前只作为桌面进程监控；需要对应 CLI 或 Hook bridge 才能远程插入指令。" = "Trae Desktop is currently monitored as a desktop process. A compatible CLI or hook bridge is required to insert remote instructions.";
"要真正发送指令，请使用“接管/启动可控会话”，TraceFence 会创建自己拥有的 CLI/PTY 会话。" = "To send real instructions, use Take Over or Start Controlled Session. TraceFence will create a CLI/PTY session that it owns.";
"这台 Mac 尚未安装可接管的 CLI Agent。" = "No supported CLI agent is installed on this Mac for takeover.";
"发送的内容会插入当前 Codex turn；也可以先中断，再发送新的后续指令。" = "The instruction is inserted into the current Codex turn. You can also interrupt first and then send a new follow-up instruction.";
"发送指令会在这个真实 Codex 会话中创建新 turn，并同步显示在 Mac 客户端。" = "Sending an instruction creates a new turn in the real Codex session and displays it in the Mac client.";
"TraceFence Agent Core 通过 Mac 本机桌面 IPC 控制真实会话，不会创建替代 Shell 会话。" = "TraceFence Agent Core controls the real session through local desktop IPC and does not create a substitute shell session.";
"TraceFence 通过 Mac 本机 Codex app-server 控制真实会话，不会创建替代 Shell 会话。" = "TraceFence controls the real session through the local Codex app server and does not create a substitute shell session.";
"Mac 和 iPhone 断网时，已提交到 Mac 的任务仍可继续，但新的远程操作需要恢复连接。" = "Tasks already submitted to the Mac can continue while disconnected, but new remote actions require the connection to return.";
"请输入下一步指令；TraceFence 会发送给可控会话，并恢复 Agent 进程组。" = "Enter the next instruction. TraceFence will send it to the controlled session and resume the agent process group.";
"这是由 TraceFence 创建的可控 Agent 会话，可被真实暂停、恢复和终止。" = "This controlled agent session was created by TraceFence and can be paused, resumed, and terminated for real.";
"该控制只覆盖通过 TraceFence 创建的可控 Agent 会话。" = "This control applies only to agent sessions created by TraceFence.";
"指令会发送给会话输入流；Agent 是否立即采纳取决于当前提示状态。" = "Instructions are written to the session input stream. Whether the agent accepts them immediately depends on its current prompt state.";
"TraceFence 只能监控此任务，当前没有找到可安全控制的终端进程或 Hook bridge。" = "TraceFence can only monitor this task because no safely controllable terminal process or hook bridge was found.";
"需要 Hook bridge、TraceFence 可控会话或 Agent API 才能插入指令。" = "Inserting instructions requires a hook bridge, a TraceFence-controlled session, or an agent API.";
"需要 Hook bridge、TraceFence 可控会话或 Agent API 才能暂停/恢复。" = "Pausing and resuming requires a hook bridge, a TraceFence-controlled session, or an agent API.";
"此任务来自日志或数据库快照，TraceFence 没有关联到仍在运行的可控进程。" = "This task comes from a log or database snapshot and is not linked to a running controllable process.";
"监控快照不等于可控运行时。" = "A monitoring snapshot is not a controllable runtime.";
"等待输入的任务必须有可写入终端才能从 iOS 发送新指令。" = "A task waiting for input needs a writable terminal before iOS can send a new instruction.";
"TraceFence Agent Core 是独立常驻服务，可在 Mac App 窗口关闭或屏幕锁定后继续控制真实会话。" = "TraceFence Agent Core is an independent background service that can continue controlling real sessions after the Mac app window closes or the screen locks.";
"Mac 进入系统睡眠或断网后，新的远程操作仍需等待网络恢复。" = "After the Mac sleeps or loses its network connection, new remote actions must wait for connectivity to return.";
"发送的内容会插入当前 Agent turn；也可以先中断，再发送新的后续指令。" = "The instruction is inserted into the current agent turn. You can also interrupt first and then send a new follow-up instruction.";
"发送指令会在这个真实 Agent 会话中创建新 turn。" = "Sending an instruction creates a new turn in this real agent session.";
